"Cellar Darling are a Swiss folk-metal trio — Anna Murphy (voice, hurdy-gurdy, flute, piano), Ivo Henzi (guitar and bass), and Merlin Sutter (drums) — who walked out of the folk-metal giants Eluveitie in 2016 and built something stranger and more personal in Lucerne and Winterthur. The name is older than the band: it was the title of Anna's 2013 solo album — an electronic record, nothing like this one — and Ivo says it was one of the first names the three considered; they kept coming back to it. The sound is her hurdy-gurdy droning over heavy, progressive folk metal — storybook and storm at once. They signed to Nuclear Blast in January 2017, after a self-released first single, Challenge, in the autumn of 2016. The albums: This Is the Sound (2017) and The Spell (2019). They are, and she will not be argued out of this, her favorite band." = "Cellar Darling एक Swiss folk-metal trio है — Anna Murphy (आवाज़, hurdy-gurdy, flute, piano), Ivo Henzi (guitar और bass), और Merlin Sutter (drums) — जो 2016 में folk-metal दिग्गज Eluveitie से निकलकर Lucerne और Winterthur में कुछ अजनबी और ज़्यादा निजी बनाने लगे। नाम band से पुराना है: यह Anna के 2013 के solo album का title था — एक electronic record, इस जैसा बिल्कुल नहीं — और Ivo कहता है कि यह उन पहले नामों में से एक था जिन पर तीनों ने विचार किया; वे बार-बार उसी पर लौटते रहे। आवाज़ उसकी hurdy-gurdy है जो heavy, progressive folk metal पर गूँजती है — storybook और तूफ़ान एक साथ। उन्होंने January 2017 में Nuclear Blast से sign किया, एक self-released पहले single, Challenge, के बाद जो autumn 2016 में आया था। Albums: This Is the Sound (2017) और The Spell (2019)। वे हैं, और वह इस पर बहस नहीं करेगी, उसका पसंदीदा band।";
