"The app's wardrobe: six built-in themes and your own — accent, glow, and tint washing every backdrop — plus per-tab backdrops: the living wallpaper, the Jolly Roger kept forever as a choice, plain colour, or your own image or GIF, copied onto the device and never leaving it." = "App की wardrobe: छह built-in themes और तुम्हारे अपने — accent, glow, और tint हर backdrop को धोते हुए — साथ में per-tab backdrops: living wallpaper, एक चुनाव के रूप में हमेशा रखा Jolly Roger, सादा colour, या तुम्हारी अपनी image या GIF, device पर copied और उसे कभी न छोड़ती हुई।";
"The block catalog. Send & Serve: send a payload (book payload, target, read-the-reply), start Serve (standing settings, or custom TCP/UDP/HTTP doors with a stealth choice), stop Serve, start/stop the beacon and GATT hosting (a book payload or literal text, wearing an air name), fire a Helm button (remote, button), apply a War Chest. Posture: go dark (EMCON on), stand down EMCON, stealth on/off, the Banshee (scream or cease), wear a costume name, don or drop a mimicry persona. Listen & Recon: start/stop listening (a session label), sweep the wire (the standing trace, waited out), a Recon knock (host, ports, UDP too), start/stop the fuzzer (target, packets, length, mutations — the runner's own bench). The War Rooms: Net-Assault arm/disarm, a War Room run start/stop, a SIGINT watch (name, scope mixed/air/wire), a War Games challenge (defender address, their port, my control port), a War Games defense (real doors as ports — 9001/udp speaks its protocol — and decoy names). Flow & Passive: wait (seconds), wait for an arrival in the Serve inbox, wait for a sighting (any new device, or a name match — the ear must be listening), a journal note, an announcement (a local notification with your text), and stop the playlist. Every block also carries a repeat count." = "Block catalog। Send & Serve: payload भेजो (book payload, target, reply पढ़ो), Serve शुरू करो (standing settings, या stealth चुनाव के साथ custom TCP/UDP/HTTP दरवाज़े), Serve रोको, beacon और GATT hosting शुरू/रोको (book payload या literal text, हवा का नाम पहने), Helm button fire करो (remote, button), War Chest लगाओ। Posture: go dark (EMCON on), EMCON stand down, stealth on/off, Banshee (चिल्लाओ या बंद करो), costume name पहनो, mimicry persona धारण करो या उतारो। Listen & Recon: listening शुरू/रोको (session label), wire sweep करो (standing trace, इंतज़ार करके), Recon knock (host, ports, UDP भी), fuzzer शुरू/रोको (target, packets, length, mutations — runner का अपना bench)। War Rooms: Net-Assault arm/disarm, War Room run शुरू/रोको, SIGINT watch (name, scope mixed/air/wire), War Games challenge (defender address, उनका port, मेरा control port), War Games defense (असली दरवाज़े ports के रूप में — 9001/udp अपना protocol बोलता है — और decoy names)। Flow & Passive: wait (seconds), Serve inbox में arrival का wait, sighting का wait (कोई नया device, या name match — कान सुन रहा होना चाहिए), journal note, announcement (तुम्हारे text के साथ local notification), और playlist रोको। हर block एक repeat count भी लिए है।";
"The census the house knocks by default: 22 SSH, 80 and 8080 and 8443 and 443 the web in its forms, 445 SMB file sharing, 1883 MQTT the chatty IoT bus, 9100 the printer's raw door. Beyond the defaults: 53 DNS, 5353 is mDNS and not knocked but heard, 62078 is an iPhone's lockdownd answering. An open port names a service's claim to be there; the banner, when one is offered, is the service introducing itself — believed accordingly." = "वह census जिस पर घर default रूप से दस्तक देता है: 22 SSH, 80 और 8080 और 8443 और 443 web अपने रूपों में, 445 SMB file sharing, 1883 MQTT chatty IoT bus, 9100 printer का raw दरवाज़ा। Defaults से आगे: 53 DNS, 5353 mDNS है और खटखटाया नहीं, सुना जाता है, 62078 iPhone का lockdownd जवाब देता हुआ। खुला port किसी service के वहाँ होने के दावे का नाम है; banner, जब पेश किया जाए, service का अपना परिचय है — उसी हिसाब से माना गया।";
